{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3z4NDy9wVJt7gEHiPK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient door stands before you, its surface weathering countless ages. A single keyhole glows faintly.*\n\nYou present the key.\n\n*A deep resonance hums through the frame. Tumblers shift — one, two, three — mechanisms older than memory falling into alignment.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*The door shudders. A thin line of light splits vertically down its center, widening. Warm air rushes past you carrying the scent of rain on stone, of libraries, of somewhere else entirely.*\n\n*The door is open.*\n\n*Beyond: a corridor of soft amber light stretching forward, its walls lined with doors upon doors upon doors — each one different, each one waiting, each one asking the same question you just answered.*\n\n**You may pass.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":173,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}